<title>POLAND: Polish bourse order-balancing results delayed.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse order-balancing results delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of the final results of the Warsaw bourse's order-balancing session after price-fixing will be delayed on Monday, a bourse representative said, giving no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
